  maxEntries: 5
  summary: 
  entries:
  - Speaker: Player
    Text: Hello Rocky
    Timestamp: 40386.66
  - Speaker: Rocky
    Text: Whaddaya mean, 'hello'? You're talkin' to me? Ha! No one ever gave me a
      chance to say hello. What's there to chat about?
    Timestamp: 40549.598
  - Speaker: Player
    Text: I think that Elian is talking trash about you
    Timestamp: 43011.848
  - Speaker: Rocky
    Text: I know Elian thinks he's tough, but I've been through worse and come out
      on top. Bring it on if that's what he wants.
    Timestamp: 43232.523
  - Speaker: Player
    Text: Wow wow hold up buddy. You need to calm down
    Timestamp: 45135.234
  - Speaker: Rocky
    Text: Dude, chill out! I'm tryin' to help you find that mineral! You're gettin'
      all worked up over nothin'
    Timestamp: 45358.39
