  entries:
  - Speaker: Player
    Text: hi
    Timestamp: 40244.168
  - Speaker: Rocky
    Text: What's up, Player? I'm Rocky. Just digging some new paths in the mines.
      You know, trying to find that one rare mineral that'll make my dad proud. He
      never thought I had what it takes since I was a kid. But hey, I got this whole
      hearing thing going on now. It's like having a superpower!
    Timestamp: 41103.094
  - Speaker: Player
    Text: Bye
    Timestamp: 42432.453
  - Speaker: Rocky
    Text: Bye, Player. I'll be back in the mines, trying to find that hard mineral.
      See you around.
    Timestamp: 42631.703
